1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,170
Look at this! The likes are through the roof!

2
00:00:03,170 --> 00:00:06,160
Thailand, Indonesia, even America!

3
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:09,740
Folks from all over the world are liking our videos!

4
00:00:09,740 --> 00:00:12,350
Great job, Hana-chan.

5
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:16,710
You and Eun Ho did all the hard work.

6
00:00:16,710 --> 00:00:18,410
Don't say that.

7
00:00:18,410 --> 00:00:20,770
- Did you have breakfast?
- Nope.

8
00:00:20,770 --> 00:00:22,450
Shall we grab something from the store?

9
00:00:22,450 --> 00:00:24,970
- Okay.
- Let's go.

10
00:00:26,410 --> 00:00:29,780
I'm starving!

11
00:00:31,310 --> 00:00:35,670
♫♫

12
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:40,160
♫♫

13
00:00:41,470 --> 00:00:44,920
[People are really liking it, huh?]

14
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:48,910
♫♫

15
00:00:48,910 --> 00:00:53,620
♫♫

16
00:00:53,620 --> 00:00:58,410
♫♫

17
00:01:28,360 --> 00:01:31,910
[Episode 3: Full Bloom]

18
00:01:35,950 --> 00:01:38,600
Oh? When did you get these?

19
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:42,530
I've got everything.

20
00:01:43,380 --> 00:01:45,990
Apply it for me! I even lowered myself to your height.

21
00:01:46,750 --> 00:01:49,490
Did you see the posts from Hana's team?

22
00:01:49,490 --> 00:01:51,500
It's insane, right?

23
00:01:51,500 --> 00:01:55,090
I really thought I was eating pork cutlets with Gu Eun Ho.

24
00:01:55,090 --> 00:01:57,310
It isn't just eating with him!

25
00:01:57,310 --> 00:02:01,280
His precious hands cut it for me!

26
00:02:02,190 --> 00:02:06,190
It'll be amazing if it became a series.

27
00:02:06,190 --> 00:02:09,210
Oh, a series is a great idea.

28
00:02:09,210 --> 00:02:13,560
But I guess someone's going to be jealous if they blow up.

29
00:02:14,910 --> 00:02:17,180
Come on.

30
00:02:17,180 --> 00:02:19,950
Let's go, let's go.

31
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:39,070
A series?

32
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:45,130
Ji Ah!

33
00:02:49,050 --> 00:02:52,250
- Did I scare you?
- Yeah, what else?

34
00:02:53,080 --> 00:02:55,170
Especially after you filmed all that.

35
00:02:55,170 --> 00:02:58,060
Sorry, I was too excited.

36
00:02:59,580 --> 00:03:01,910
Actually, I hate it when people touch me.

37
00:03:01,910 --> 00:03:05,430
Really? I didn't know, I'm so sorry.

38
00:03:05,430 --> 00:03:07,310
I'll be careful from now on.

39
00:03:07,310 --> 00:03:11,540
Sorry, you had to put up with me for so long.

40
00:03:17,950 --> 00:03:20,700
Ji Ah, do you want something sweet?

41
00:03:20,700 --> 00:03:24,380
A candy or some gummies?

42
00:03:30,970 --> 00:03:33,470
Are you going to make a series?

43
00:03:33,470 --> 00:03:37,010
The stuff about male friends.

44
00:03:37,010 --> 00:03:38,660
You saw it?

45
00:03:38,660 --> 00:03:42,160
I was about to go to bed,
but the notifications kept popping up.

46
00:03:42,160 --> 00:03:44,710
At first, I thought I was dreaming.

47
00:03:44,710 --> 00:03:47,070
Even now, it still feels unreal.

48
00:03:48,030 --> 00:03:50,800
So, is it going to be a series?

49
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:52,230
Yes.

50
00:03:52,230 --> 00:03:54,320
I owe it all to you.

51
00:03:54,320 --> 00:03:58,270
You said that even a selfie would work.

52
00:03:58,270 --> 00:04:04,170
Instead of selfies, I uploaded memories.

53
00:04:05,640 --> 00:04:10,430
I work my life out trying to complete assignments,

54
00:04:11,330 --> 00:04:15,980
but you sound like you're just making memories with the guys.

55
00:04:15,980 --> 00:04:18,410
Ji Ah, you're capable.

56
00:04:18,410 --> 00:04:21,440
I have nothing.

57
00:04:21,440 --> 00:04:24,360
Eun Ho and Si Woo are doing all the hard work.

58
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:26,330
I guess that's right.

59
00:04:26,330 --> 00:04:28,820
Group distribution is all about luck.

60
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:05,220
♫♫

61
00:05:05,220 --> 00:05:08,600
♫♫

62
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:12,540
♫♫

63
00:05:12,540 --> 00:05:17,110
♫♫

64
00:05:20,060 --> 00:05:22,510
I'm going to throw up my lunch.

65
00:05:22,510 --> 00:05:25,790
Hey, get up. We have to practice.

66
00:05:25,790 --> 00:05:30,380
We can't get up, or it'll be disastrous.

67
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:36,570
Just curious, but do you have insurance?

68
00:05:36,570 --> 00:05:38,730
No clue...

69
00:05:38,730 --> 00:05:40,900
Should I call my mom?

70
00:05:45,990 --> 00:05:49,100
What? Go on sleeping.

71
00:05:49,100 --> 00:05:51,780
- Should I turn off the lights?
- Ji Ah.

72
00:05:51,780 --> 00:05:54,860
Give us a break. Ba Reun, tell her.

73
00:05:54,860 --> 00:05:57,160
Let her know how hard we were practicing!

74
00:05:57,160 --> 00:06:00,080
You're so mean!

75
00:06:02,650 --> 00:06:04,670
The like button is the issue.

76
00:06:04,670 --> 00:06:07,340
Why can we only like a post once?

77
00:06:07,340 --> 00:06:09,930
Why? Why's that?

78
00:06:11,130 --> 00:06:14,260
Spare a thought for people who want to watch it 100 times.

79
00:06:14,260 --> 00:06:16,080
You're really something.

80
00:06:16,080 --> 00:06:19,150
I can watch this 200 times.

81
00:06:20,550 --> 00:06:23,850
I'm really sorry, Eun Ho.

82
00:06:28,510 --> 00:06:30,830
Get her here. Right now.

83
00:06:53,930 --> 00:06:55,470
Hello.

84
00:06:55,470 --> 00:06:57,410
Hello.

85
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:12,920
I still haven't gotten their selfie.

86
00:07:16,980 --> 00:07:18,810
You're really cunning.

87
00:07:18,810 --> 00:07:21,270
I heard from Eun Ho.

88
00:07:28,590 --> 00:07:30,680
Whatever that happened...

89
00:07:32,910 --> 00:07:34,720
Let's leave it in the past.

90
00:07:35,510 --> 00:07:38,730
I have a different task for you today.

91
00:07:40,370 --> 00:07:45,180
You know that my dream is to be Eun Ho's girlfriend, right?

92
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:48,230
But...

93
00:07:51,290 --> 00:07:53,590
Your group's reels are a real feast!

94
00:07:53,590 --> 00:07:56,880
It's freaking crazy, like I'm on a date with Eun Ho.

95
00:07:56,880 --> 00:07:58,840
Is that a compliment?

96
00:07:58,840 --> 00:08:00,290
Hell yes!

97
00:08:00,290 --> 00:08:03,220
You have our approval!

98
00:08:03,220 --> 00:08:05,310
Our approval!

99
00:08:05,310 --> 00:08:08,500
So, I've gathered some fan requests.

100
00:08:08,500 --> 00:08:10,300
Hear me out.

101
00:08:11,150 --> 00:08:14,230
The amusement park, arcade, karaoke, cafe, one-day classes...

102
00:08:14,230 --> 00:08:16,190
- Han River.
- That's a great idea.

103
00:08:16,190 --> 00:08:18,600
Seongsu-dong, Sangsu-dong. These are different places.

104
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:21,310
Even a beauty shop trip will be great! A makeover!

105
00:08:21,310 --> 00:08:23,620
I'll think about it.

106
00:08:23,620 --> 00:08:28,380
But what's that about Eun Ho and the selfie?

107
00:08:28,380 --> 00:08:32,260
Oh, I know that you screwed things up.

108
00:08:32,260 --> 00:08:35,250
Too obvious. He came after me less than 10 minutes after.

109
00:08:35,250 --> 00:08:37,240
Exactly.

110
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:39,080
Please do a Han River video! How about a picnic?

111
00:08:39,080 --> 00:08:42,030
- That'll be amazing!
- Packing lunch boxes too!

112
00:08:42,030 --> 00:08:43,910
Please! Make sure it happens!

113
00:08:43,910 --> 00:08:46,570
- Thanks.
- Please!

114
00:08:57,810 --> 00:09:00,940
Where were you? We waited for ages.

115
00:09:05,910 --> 00:09:08,820
Waited? You're clearly having fun.

116
00:09:09,430 --> 00:09:12,000
You should've said something before leaving.

117
00:09:14,610 --> 00:09:17,370
I'm their manager.

118
00:09:18,460 --> 00:09:21,820
I can't fall for him!

119
00:09:21,820 --> 00:09:23,830
I have to get used to this!

120
00:09:27,530 --> 00:09:31,320
[April Week 1 Acting Course Workshop:
Social Media Posts Results]

121
00:09:32,710 --> 00:09:36,930
- Hello!
- Hana, come over! You did well!

122
00:09:39,340 --> 00:09:40,710
I thought the assignment was too hard

123
00:09:40,710 --> 00:09:42,690
since you hadn't posted anything even until yesterday.

124
00:09:42,690 --> 00:09:44,610
How did you climb to the top in just one day?

125
00:09:44,610 --> 00:09:47,100
I guess you really thought this over.

126
00:09:48,140 --> 00:09:51,230
Every Friday, I'll put up the results.

127
00:09:51,230 --> 00:09:54,750
I'll look forward to your works.

128
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:57,740
Thank you very much.

129
00:10:02,950 --> 00:10:06,010
[Follower: Hana, Ji Ah, Seul Gi, Bit Na]
[Likes: Hana, Ji Ah, Seul Gi, Bit Na]

130
00:10:13,380 --> 00:10:15,510
Wow, I'm last.

131
00:10:15,510 --> 00:10:20,590
Ji Ah's going to be first anyway... what the heck?

132
00:10:20,590 --> 00:10:23,090
- She isn't!
- Dang!

133
00:10:23,090 --> 00:10:25,880
Was she overtaken in just 10 hours?

134
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:29,440
Oh dear, Ji Ah.

135
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:31,470
This is the first time you've come in second, right?

136
00:10:31,470 --> 00:10:34,710
Shouldn't this call for a commemorative photo?

137
00:10:36,490 --> 00:10:40,470
I'll be first again, so shut up and get lost.

138
00:10:40,470 --> 00:10:41,960
Ji Ah.

139
00:10:43,420 --> 00:10:46,300
Huh? She told me to get lost, but she left.

140
00:10:46,300 --> 00:10:48,390
Her temper's crap.

141
00:10:48,390 --> 00:10:51,470
Her personality's out of this world, huh.

142
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:54,340
Hana-chan.

143
00:10:54,340 --> 00:10:57,380
She never cared to make friends before.

144
00:10:57,380 --> 00:11:02,680
But she lets you get close because you're Ba Reun's cousin.

145
00:11:03,300 --> 00:11:05,590
So, here's the thing.

146
00:11:05,590 --> 00:11:09,540
If you don't have anyone to hang out with, join us.

147
00:11:11,370 --> 00:11:14,280
Aren't you going to continue with the series?

148
00:11:15,220 --> 00:11:17,270
Take turns reading it out.

149
00:11:19,270 --> 00:11:21,190
Are we really doing this?

150
00:11:23,590 --> 00:11:26,000
I saw it 1,219 times! Heart!

151
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:29,250
My life has been blessed. Wish you all the best.

152
00:11:29,250 --> 00:11:33,150
My drowsiness is all gone now! Thank you!

153
00:11:33,150 --> 00:11:36,340
Let's vote. Affection or aloof?

154
00:11:36,340 --> 00:11:38,110
My pain's all gone now!

155
00:11:38,110 --> 00:11:41,240
Si Woo, I love you so much!

156
00:11:42,540 --> 00:11:45,120
My blood type? You, my ideal type.

157
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:46,480
I heard that roses are in season now.

158
00:11:46,480 --> 00:11:48,750
Si Woo's rosy cheeks.

159
00:11:48,750 --> 00:11:49,970
You don't rinse after brushing, right?

160
00:11:49,970 --> 00:11:51,140
Because you're already my prince!

161
00:11:51,140 --> 00:11:52,900
Eun Hoo's eyes are brighter than my future!

162
00:11:52,900 --> 00:11:55,560
I want to be the owner of this phone!

163
00:11:57,750 --> 00:12:00,360
The rest are in English, so I don't understand.

164
00:12:02,440 --> 00:12:04,130
Don't you think anything about these?

165
00:12:04,130 --> 00:12:05,570
They're really interesting.

166
00:12:05,570 --> 00:12:08,720
Hana-chan did nothing except film them!

167
00:12:08,720 --> 00:12:12,120
But I'm the only one serious about this!

168
00:12:12,120 --> 00:12:15,380
You should just film us casually, too. Don't be too serious.

169
00:12:15,380 --> 00:12:17,100
Are you telling me to copy her?

170
00:12:17,100 --> 00:12:20,150
Why fight so desperately for first place?

171
00:12:20,150 --> 00:12:25,350
Look at me, I'm living so well ranking 20th in the Acting course.

172
00:12:26,490 --> 00:12:30,690
Guys like you make me hate group projects.

173
00:12:35,210 --> 00:12:37,940
"Guys like you"? What the heck?

174
00:12:40,050 --> 00:12:42,260
Why are you dating her?

175
00:12:42,260 --> 00:12:43,960
Don't say that.

176
00:12:43,960 --> 00:12:47,120
It'll be nice... to be first.

177
00:13:10,290 --> 00:13:14,410
I'll repeat exactly as Ji Ah said.

178
00:13:15,860 --> 00:13:17,300
Okay.

179
00:13:19,550 --> 00:13:22,590
She's very sensitive and concerned about her grades.

180
00:13:22,590 --> 00:13:26,050
During the workshop, keeping your distance
as competitors is better.

181
00:13:26,050 --> 00:13:27,900
Is Ji Ah...

182
00:13:29,410 --> 00:13:33,490
being nice to me just because I'm your cousin?

183
00:13:37,100 --> 00:13:39,090
Be honest.

184
00:13:42,480 --> 00:13:48,110
That was how it started,
but she seemed to gradually treat you as her friend.

185
00:13:48,110 --> 00:13:53,550
Right now, I think she's riled up
because grades matter to her.

186
00:13:55,540 --> 00:14:01,340
Tell her...

187
00:14:02,700 --> 00:14:05,450
I've always seen her as a friend.

188
00:14:07,570 --> 00:14:09,420
I'll also continue to be her friend.

189
00:14:11,510 --> 00:14:16,110
Got it. I'm on your side this time.

190
00:14:17,130 --> 00:14:19,320
Don't be too upset.

191
00:14:42,800 --> 00:14:45,200
Leave it to me.

192
00:14:47,290 --> 00:14:48,810
Hi.

193
00:14:51,110 --> 00:14:52,810
Good morning.

194
00:14:52,810 --> 00:14:54,820
Did you think about what we told you?

195
00:14:54,820 --> 00:14:57,240
How are things going?

196
00:14:57,240 --> 00:15:00,570
- Good.
- Promise to make them pack lunches.

197
00:15:02,480 --> 00:15:04,430
Do you know what Polaroids are?

198
00:15:04,430 --> 00:15:08,380
Taking photos with this will be even more awesome.

199
00:15:08,380 --> 00:15:13,180
Hey. Are you even listening to me?

200
00:15:14,200 --> 00:15:18,200
Damn, is Gu Eun Ho insane? My dear kitty...

201
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:20,730
Yikes.

202
00:15:22,990 --> 00:15:27,050
Long time no see, "Ugh" Ji Ah. You make my eyes hurt.

203
00:15:27,050 --> 00:15:28,850
Hang on.

204
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:31,200
What?

205
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:33,950
I guess you aren't keeping up with old habits.

206
00:15:33,950 --> 00:15:37,340
Of course not, the manager's doing everything for me.

207
00:15:37,340 --> 00:15:39,180
So dumb.

208
00:15:39,770 --> 00:15:43,860
It isn't for you, they're enjoying their time.

209
00:15:44,800 --> 00:15:46,960
Who are you talking about?

210
00:15:46,960 --> 00:15:49,310
Gu Eun Ho and his manager.

211
00:15:49,310 --> 00:15:52,130
They're recording their memories.

212
00:15:52,130 --> 00:15:56,270
Social media has always been an exhibit of happiness.

213
00:15:57,210 --> 00:16:01,690
I've heard that she visits his house often.

214
00:16:02,950 --> 00:16:05,530
Is that why he came to me?

215
00:16:05,530 --> 00:16:07,780
Is that why he calls her that?

216
00:16:07,780 --> 00:16:09,790
Damn it.

217
00:16:18,810 --> 00:16:21,200
If you don't show any respect,

218
00:16:22,220 --> 00:16:24,470
I'll do the same.

219
00:16:47,590 --> 00:16:49,310
Eun Ho?

220
00:16:56,640 --> 00:16:59,770
This looks like someone...

221
00:17:03,050 --> 00:17:05,180
Did you fall out with Shin Ji Ah?

222
00:17:06,170 --> 00:17:07,690
No.

223
00:17:08,410 --> 00:17:12,810
It isn't a fight, we're just giving each other space.

224
00:17:15,930 --> 00:17:17,650
What? Are you two a couple?

225
00:17:22,090 --> 00:17:27,470
What's the most important thing to you?

226
00:17:37,040 --> 00:17:38,700
What about you?

227
00:17:45,010 --> 00:17:46,910
Friends.

228
00:18:00,980 --> 00:18:02,860
Try guessing where it is.

229
00:18:02,860 --> 00:18:06,260
If you get it right, you'll make up with Ji Ah.

230
00:18:06,260 --> 00:18:10,540
I told you, we didn't fight.

231
00:18:17,790 --> 00:18:19,540
The right hand.

232
00:18:33,820 --> 00:18:35,440
You're right.

233
00:18:36,970 --> 00:18:38,620
Take it.

234
00:18:41,530 --> 00:18:43,250
Isn't this...

235
00:18:49,630 --> 00:18:51,870
I have more at home.

236
00:18:54,010 --> 00:18:55,720
Thank you.

237
00:18:55,720 --> 00:18:58,780
I'll keep it with me like a lucky charm.

238
00:18:59,590 --> 00:19:02,370
A lucky charm that gives me courage.

239
00:19:09,780 --> 00:19:11,610
Do whatever you want.

240
00:19:20,580 --> 00:19:22,180
I'm off.

241
00:20:21,080 --> 00:20:22,850
What is it this time?

242
00:20:22,850 --> 00:20:25,250
Now that I think about it,

243
00:20:25,250 --> 00:20:28,650
your face doesn't appear in the reels.

244
00:20:28,650 --> 00:20:32,660
I guess I can film Eun Ho, too.

245
00:20:33,600 --> 00:20:36,800
You can't do that. It's our course's assignment.

246
00:20:36,800 --> 00:20:38,440
I'm also great at video editing.

247
00:20:38,440 --> 00:20:42,640
Let's crush Shin Ji Ah for good this time.

248
00:20:44,870 --> 00:20:46,430
Don't wanna do it?

249
00:20:48,380 --> 00:20:52,550
You're using your assignment as an excuse
to make happy memories with our Eun Ho.

250
00:20:52,550 --> 00:20:54,740
What have you been doing in the club room?

251
00:20:57,280 --> 00:20:59,580
Did you come here to seduce Eun Ho?

252
00:20:59,580 --> 00:21:04,260
If you become a manager, your artistes' lives will be ruined.

253
00:21:04,260 --> 00:21:08,270
A manager who's so satisfied with her job
and brimming with ulterior motives.

254
00:21:08,270 --> 00:21:12,170
A scheming and utterly disgusting manager.

255
00:21:12,170 --> 00:21:14,280
Go bother Cheon Si Woo.

256
00:21:14,280 --> 00:21:16,600
Why are you clinging to Eun Ho...

257
00:21:18,120 --> 00:21:20,410
Stop messing with me!

258
00:21:26,940 --> 00:21:29,720
It's your turn next.

259
00:21:40,070 --> 00:21:46,030
You trampled over what I treasure the most.

260
00:21:46,870 --> 00:21:49,660
What? The keychain?

261
00:21:49,660 --> 00:21:51,700
What's the big deal with that?

262
00:21:51,700 --> 00:21:53,580
This isn't the first time you're doing this.

263
00:21:53,580 --> 00:21:58,050
At first, you wanted to send Ji Ah to hell.

264
00:21:58,640 --> 00:22:03,250
Have you been to hell yourself?

265
00:22:03,840 --> 00:22:05,770
I have.

266
00:22:07,150 --> 00:22:10,830
Secondly, Si Woo.

267
00:22:10,830 --> 00:22:14,280
Are you even worthy of saying his name?

268
00:22:15,440 --> 00:22:18,360
Thirdly, Eun Ho.

269
00:22:18,360 --> 00:22:24,110
Dream about becoming a human
before thinking about being his girlfriend.

270
00:22:26,580 --> 00:22:30,530
Lastly, Suzu and me.

271
00:22:32,770 --> 00:22:35,240
I'll count to five.

272
00:22:35,900 --> 00:22:37,980
Get out of my sight.

273
00:22:38,610 --> 00:22:43,290
One, two, three...

274
00:22:47,910 --> 00:22:50,190
What happened?

275
00:22:50,190 --> 00:22:52,950
She's definitely a gangster's daughter.

276
00:22:52,950 --> 00:22:54,600
What?

277
00:23:00,950 --> 00:23:03,150
There's something really off about her.

278
00:23:14,150 --> 00:23:15,790
Interesting.

279
00:23:38,040 --> 00:23:40,430
I can't sit with her.

280
00:23:40,430 --> 00:23:43,030
I'm also really scared of her now.

281
00:23:43,030 --> 00:23:46,020
She's like a different person.

282
00:23:46,020 --> 00:23:48,640
But at least she didn't use her fists.

283
00:24:12,240 --> 00:24:14,540
So handsome!

284
00:24:15,340 --> 00:24:16,710
So freaking good-looking!

285
00:24:16,710 --> 00:24:19,270
And he's so tall! I bet he's a model!

286
00:24:19,270 --> 00:24:21,490
Take a photo! Quick!

287
00:24:21,490 --> 00:24:24,720
But can we just take photos?

288
00:24:24,720 --> 00:24:26,220
Here, wear this.

289
00:24:26,220 --> 00:24:28,220
I think people recognize you.

290
00:24:28,220 --> 00:24:31,860
Let's go. Si Woo says he'll be late.

291
00:24:31,860 --> 00:24:34,550
But people are staring.

292
00:24:37,700 --> 00:24:39,500
Fine, give it to me.

293
00:24:49,350 --> 00:24:52,440
The weather's great today.

294
00:24:52,440 --> 00:24:53,960
What should we do?

295
00:24:53,960 --> 00:24:57,710
Let's start with eating instant noodles,
and then riding the duck boats.

296
00:24:57,710 --> 00:25:01,040
Do you get motion sickness?

297
00:25:01,880 --> 00:25:03,540
Let's have a picnic or something.

298
00:25:03,540 --> 00:25:06,050
A picnic?

299
00:25:06,050 --> 00:25:08,940
You should've said so earlier.

300
00:25:08,940 --> 00:25:11,940
I would've prepared for it.

301
00:25:12,840 --> 00:25:14,880
There's nothing much to prepare.

302
00:25:19,130 --> 00:25:21,690
What are you doing?

303
00:25:21,690 --> 00:25:24,930
- Follow me.
- Hey!

304
00:25:42,280 --> 00:25:44,780
What is all this?

305
00:25:48,840 --> 00:25:52,240
What do you think? I tried to fit our group's concept.

306
00:25:52,240 --> 00:25:55,690
We had a concept?

307
00:25:55,690 --> 00:25:59,760
You came up with it, eating and having fun without worries.

308
00:26:02,030 --> 00:26:03,790
Come on, sit down.

309
00:26:06,980 --> 00:26:10,090
I bet you're hungry.

310
00:26:12,430 --> 00:26:15,740
Hana-chan, let's watch a movie.

311
00:26:17,750 --> 00:26:21,130
I picked these movies.

312
00:26:22,320 --> 00:26:24,790
Want to watch them?

313
00:26:27,900 --> 00:26:30,220
I like this one.

314
00:26:30,220 --> 00:26:31,900
How about watching this?

315
00:26:31,900 --> 00:26:33,960
Or this one?

316
00:26:38,260 --> 00:26:43,550
A kind male friend who prepared a surprise picnic.

317
00:26:44,550 --> 00:26:47,430
Skip the movie. Let's play games.

318
00:26:47,430 --> 00:26:49,250
The loser gets flicked on the forehead.

319
00:26:49,250 --> 00:26:52,440
Aren't you going to take a block?

320
00:26:52,440 --> 00:26:54,750
Are you just going to film?

321
00:26:54,750 --> 00:26:56,240
Hey.

322
00:26:59,490 --> 00:27:01,300
Hana-chan, it's your turn.

323
00:27:02,630 --> 00:27:06,690
♫♫

324
00:27:06,690 --> 00:27:09,570
♫♫

325
00:27:09,570 --> 00:27:12,110
♫♫

326
00:27:12,110 --> 00:27:14,200
♫♫

327
00:27:14,200 --> 00:27:16,490
♫♫

328
00:27:16,490 --> 00:27:21,160
An aloof male friend who flicked my forehead gently.

329
00:27:21,160 --> 00:27:25,580
♫♫

330
00:27:25,580 --> 00:27:32,770
♫♫

331
00:27:32,770 --> 00:27:36,830
♫♫

332
00:27:37,530 --> 00:27:40,040
Hang on!

333
00:27:41,400 --> 00:27:45,690
♫♫

334
00:27:46,550 --> 00:27:49,230
♫♫

335
00:27:49,230 --> 00:27:51,020
♫♫

336
00:27:51,020 --> 00:27:53,840
♫♫

337
00:27:53,840 --> 00:27:58,170
♫♫

338
00:27:58,170 --> 00:28:00,530
♫♫

339
00:28:00,530 --> 00:28:06,300
And me, smiling brightly without any worries.

340
00:28:19,280 --> 00:28:21,950
Make way. I'll do it.

341
00:28:22,620 --> 00:28:25,030
It's almost done anyway.

342
00:28:28,380 --> 00:28:30,060
I guess you're having fun.

343
00:28:30,060 --> 00:28:31,680
Yeah!

344
00:28:39,520 --> 00:28:41,140
But...

345
00:28:47,150 --> 00:28:49,890
you're a manager, so why are you acting?

346
00:29:13,270 --> 00:29:16,050
